peed</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Acceleration</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Turbo</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091700/extras/47da6ae119f739093e3ddcdda149d7c1.avif?t=1772489571\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE TYPES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into four different race modes, each with its own twist on high-speed robotic Cat racing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RollCats Race</strong> – Classic 3-lap arcade races with weapons and boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caterminator</strong> – Survival race where the last Cat is eliminated every lap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Lap</strong> – Pure speed runs: no combat, just racing against the clock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mousë Catch</strong> – Chase the Mice in this fast-paced special mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091700/extras/2658ade5a0feb9b07a1e4189d531f2ff.avif?t=1772489571\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Race high-speed robotic Cats on massive wheels across alien planets. Drift, shoot and boost your way to victory!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Hungarian, Slovak, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091700/aae42257580bbfb01e8d806a6d2894377473557f/header.jpg?t=1772489571", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s